      "heading": "Basis, controls and limitations",
      "text": "Basis: USD; calendar fiscal years; recognized revenue, not bookings; operating income excludes no additional adjustments and is not net income or cash flow.\nOperating emphasis: Profitable scale\nRisk: working-capital exposure from accelerated production commitments\nMitigation: stage capacity commitments against qualification and accepted schedules\nStrategy: Own differentiated silicon architecture and application validation; use external manufacturing rather than build a wafer fab.\nLiquidity: No cash balance, debt balance, free-cash-flow measure or forecast is included.\nAvailability: Only quarters knowable on the publication date are included.\nFormula controls: Inputs precede formulas; saved formula values are checked after reopening.\nColor convention: Blue numbers are source inputs. Green numbers are formula-linked outputs.\nScope: This is an operating-economics workbook, not a balance sheet or cash-flow model.",
